WEBVTT

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.503
which is the longest river
in Papua New Guinea.

00:01:31.754 --> 00:01:34.465
The Sepik River is the lifeblood

00:01:34.507 --> 00:01:36.676
and is our heritage.

00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:41.013
The people living around the area
are called Sepik.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.765
Interestingly,

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:45.184
that is our identity

00:01:45.184 --> 00:01:49.772
and our existence are intertwined

00:01:49.814 --> 00:01:52.859
with this unhurried body of water,

00:01:52.859 --> 00:01:54.277
this winding river.

